{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104031335816-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104031838\"/><p>檢獲的霹靂可卡因。</p><p>九龍城區警員根據線報及經深入調查，昨晚（3日）在尖沙咀加連威老道展開反毒品行動，搗破一個懷疑毒品儲存及分銷中心。人員突擊搜查一住宅單位，檢獲約107克懷疑霹靂可卡因及一批毒品包裝工具，並以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」拘捕單位內1名28歲本地女子，她現正被扣留調查。行動中，檢獲的毒品市值約11.7萬港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T19:40:50.382701+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T19:13:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:27.178202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T19:38:35.611721+00:00","content_hash":"d2d22c2d2ea926b5b93ef830743036c7f78e7081ab56da9a0c10c7cccf038ddc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T19:40:50.382701+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}